   "fieldtype": "Check",
   "label": "Collect via Malipopay",
   "default": "0",
   "description": "Registers this project's control numbers with Malipopay too, so customers can pay the same number through Malipopay as well. Malipopay follows the issuer: when a number is declined, its Malipopay bill is expired."
