   "label": "Control Numbers Issued By",
   "options": "TCB\nMalipopay",
   "default": "TCB",
   "description": "The channel whose numbering issues this project's control numbers (the independent channel). Must be one of the ticked channels above. Every OTHER ticked channel is dependent on it: it collects against the same number and receives payment/reversal echoes. The issuer receives no echoes.",
